    feat: implement per-lump frequency handling for mixed-frequency self-grav pairs
    
    Enhanced the self-grav scripts and related modules to support per-lump U(1) phase velocities, allowing mixed-frequency pairs to operate effectively. Updated `run_pair_selfgrav.sh` to include a new `BONDI_S1_OMEGA` variable for specifying individual lump frequencies, ensuring unique output naming conventions. Modified the boson star and solver parameter files to accommodate per-lump frequency settings, improving the accuracy of self-grav solutions. Added a new test case to validate the functionality of per-lump frequency wiring, ensuring robust performance across mixed-frequency scenarios.

